    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "In 1908 Lord Northcliffe offered a prize of ￡1, 000 to the first man who would fly across the English Channel.",
      "translation": "1908年，诺思克利夫勋爵提出，谁要是第一个飞越英吉利海峡，就送给谁1,000英镑奖金。",
      "startTime": 15.81,
      "endTime": 26.77,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "prize",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "奖金，奖品"
          },
          {
            "word": "channel",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "海峡"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Over a year passed before the first attempt was made.",
      "translation": "一年多过去了，才有人出来尝试。",
      "startTime": 26.78,
      "endTime": 31.27,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
