            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "尝试"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "On July 19th, 1909, in the early morning, Hubert Latham took off from the French coast in his plane the 'Antoinette IV.'",
      "translation": "1909年7月19日凌晨，休伯特·莱瑟姆驾驶他的“安托瓦内特4号”飞机从法国海岸起飞。",
      "startTime": 31.28,
      "endTime": 43.13,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "take off",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "起飞"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "He had travelled only seven miles across the Channel when his engine failed and he was forced to land on the sea.",
      "translation": "他只在海峡上空飞行了7英里，引擎就出了故障，他被迫降落在海面上。",
      "startTime": 43.14,
      "endTime": 52.25,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "engine",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "引擎"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The 'Antoinette' floated on the water until Latham was picked up by a ship.",
      "translation": "“安托瓦内特”号在水面上漂浮着，直到莱瑟姆被一艘船救起。",
